    {
      "id": "r1_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 128,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 130,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753228800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zuul 1 (Servlet, blocking)\n\nThread per connection.\nBackend slows down \u2192 thread\nblocked longer \u2192 device retries\n\u2192 more incoming connections\n\u2192 fewer free threads.\n\nThread exhaustion feeds\nretry storm.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zuul 1 (Servlet, blocking)\n\nThread per connection.\nBackend slows down \u2192 thread\nblocked longer \u2192 device retries\n\u2192 more incoming connections\n\u2192 fewer free threads.\n\nThread exhaustion feeds\nretry storm.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
